Run.Description Graphene Kubo (Lanczos recursion) density of states
Run.Prefix generate

Run.TypeOfSystem Graphene
TB.Hopping 3.1

Structure.CellSize 1
Structure.SuperCell 300

Kubo.Calc .true.
Diag.Calc .false.
Calculate.OnlyDOS .true.

Kubo.RecursionNumber 200
Kubo.NumberofEnergyPoints 201
Kubo.Epsilon 0.05
Kubo.EnergyMin 0-9.0
Kubo.EnergyMax 9.0

# Reproducible random-phase state (the default seed is taken from the clock)
Kubo.SetSeed .true.
Kubo.SeedValue 123456

TB.NeighLevels 1

Output.WriteDataFiles .false.
WritePos .false.
